      "created_at": "2017-06-06T12:34:14.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Does anyone know if GTG allows visitors to drop by to say “Hi” and see the facility for a few minutes when they are in town? Just found out that I am going to St Louis next week (be there on the 14th &amp; 15th for work) and would love to stop by.</p>\n<p>I did this to Handelabra back in April and had a lot of fun chatting with them for a few minutes.</p>\n<p>I hope it is possible, but I totally would understand if it is too much of a disruption to have people dropping in.</p>",
