      "raw": "[quote=\"much0gust0\"]\n\nHaha, it truly shows how special this &nbsp;company is that people would want to randomly stop by a stranger&#39;s workplace. I love everything about this.\n\n[/quote]\n\nYou&#39;re not wrong. OTH, other workplaces I&#39;ve visited for which I didn&#39;t know anyone working there are below. Most of these are tours, but then if GtG offered tours of their warehouse, I bet people would take them.\n\n&nbsp;\n<ul><li>Radiology center at IUPUI. We got a tour of the imaging machines and 3D printing. This was 10+ years ago when 3D printing was much more rare.</li><li>Tortilla factory in Cabo San Lucas. Part of a food tour.</li><li>Many vineyards and a few breweries</li><li>Candy factory in Talinn. Part of a tour.</li><li>Coffee plantation tour.</li><li>Bacardi Distillery tour.</li></ul>\n&nbsp;\n\nUgh. Remembering and listing all the tours is getting tedious, but I expect you get the point.\n",
